--TEST--
A `foreach` value binding written `var` refuses a bare array literal subject, as a `var` local refuses one — `rule:types/var-inference`
--FILE--
<?nvs
// covers: lang:statements/foreach
foreach ([1, 2, 3] as var $x) {
    echo $x, "\n";
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0414]: `var` cannot infer an array literal's element type
  --> case.nvs:3:10
